# Defense in depth: never publish original game media, extracted payloads,
# generated reports, credentials, build output or unrelated projects.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.iso
*.xbe
*.big
*.bh
*.ord
*.orl
*.o
*.xsh
*.xbx
*.ast
*.abk
*.bnk
*.evt
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.ppm
*.png
*.tga
*.jpg
*.zip
*.7z
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.pyc
*.tsv
*.csv
*.log
*.pem
*.key

# Keep documentation local except for the public root README.
**/*.md
!/README.md
